. * keyword patterns in NAME or LABEL that would signal a duration/length/sequence/start
. local kw "durat length howlong long days dias day spell multiday multi_day multi day_ ndays numday weeks week month start begin since until end finish consecu
> t sequence seq period span tenure how_many howmany lasted last_"

